---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  active=""
  path="credits"
  title="Credits | DFS Lab"
  description="Sources and licenses for the photos and logos used on the DFS Lab website"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Credits</h1>
    <p class="lede">Sources and licenses for the photos and logos used on this site.</p>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Photos</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Hard disk drive (Data Recovery card) : Wikimedia Commons, "Hard disk drive platter, Samsung MP0402H.jpg", CC BY 4.0</li>
        <li>SSD : Wikimedia Commons, "Samsung 870 QVO 8TB ... SSD023_corr.png", CC BY 4.0</li>
        <li>NVMe : Wikimedia Commons, "2023 Napęd Samsung 970 EVO Plus 250GB (1).jpg", CC BY-SA 4.0</li>
        <li>Forensic disk imager (Evidence Verification card) : Wikimedia Commons, "Forensic disk imager.jpg", CC BY-SA 4.0</li>
        <li>Paper first-page captures (News, Applied Sciences and Electronics) : MDPI, Open Access, CC BY 4.0</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Logos</h2>
      <p>The KakaoTalk, Chrome, Android, Google Cloud, iCloud, Google Drive, Dropbox, and Naver MYBOX icons are from Simple Icons (CC0, SVG). Trademarks for each icon belong to their respective companies.</p>
      <p>The AWS, Microsoft Azure, OneDrive, and Windows logos are files hosted on Wikimedia Commons.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lede { font-size: 16px; max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-muted-2); }
  .block { margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 760px; }
  .block h2 { font-size: 18px; }
  ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted-2); }
</style>
